WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.442
Assalomu alaykum.

2
00:00:01.442 --> 00:00:10.686
Ba’zi tenglamalar o‘zgaruvchilari ajralmaydi, lekin bitta aqlli almashtirishdan keyin ajraladiganga aylanadi.

3
00:00:10.686 --> 00:00:16.878
Bugun shunday tenglamalardan biri — bir jinsli tenglama bilan tanishamiz.

4
00:00:16.878 --> 00:00:22.730
Uning belgisi: rasmni kattalashtirsak, yo‘nalish maydoni o‘zgarmaydi.

5
00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:29.006
Dars oxirida siz y teng u karra x almashtirishni ishonch bilan qo‘llaysiz.

6
00:00:29.256 --> 00:00:36.666
Agar o‘ng tomonda x va y ni bir xil t songa ko‘paytirsak va natija o‘zgarmasa,

7
00:00:36.666 --> 00:00:41.130
funksiya nolinchi darajali bir jinsli deyiladi.

8
00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:46.070
Unda o‘ng tomon faqat y ning x ga nisbatiga bog‘liq.

9
00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:48.350
y teng u karra x deymiz.

10
00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:55.094
Ko‘paytmaning hosilasi bo‘yicha y shtrix teng u shtrix karra x plyus u.

11
00:00:55.094 --> 00:01:01.934
Natijada x karra u shtrix teng phi dan u minus u — ajraladigan tenglama.

12
00:01:02.184 --> 00:01:08.674
Misol: y shtrix teng x kvadrat plyus y kvadrat bo‘lingan x karra y ga.

13
00:01:08.674 --> 00:01:14.885
Surat ham, maxraj ham ikkinchi darajali, demak tenglama bir jinsli.

14
00:01:14.885 --> 00:01:23.414
Surat va maxrajni x kvadratga bo‘lsak, phi dan u teng bir bo‘lingan u plyus u hosil bo‘ladi.

15
00:01:23.664 --> 00:01:30.721
y teng u karra x ni qo‘yamiz: u shtrix karra x plyus u teng bir bo‘lingan u plyus u.

16
00:01:30.721 --> 00:01:36.097
u lar qisqaradi va x karra u shtrix teng bir bo‘lingan u qoladi.

17
00:01:36.097 --> 00:01:42.902
Bu ifoda hech qachon nolga teng emas, shuning uchun to‘g‘ri chiziqli yechim yo‘q.

18
00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:46.598
Ajratamiz: u karra d u teng d x bo‘lingan x.

19
00:01:46.848 --> 00:01:54.236
Integrallaymiz: u kvadratning yarmi teng x modulining natural logarifmi plyus C bir.

20
00:01:54.236 --> 00:01:59.688
u o‘rniga y bo‘lingan x ni qaytaramiz va ikkiga ko‘paytiramiz.

21
00:01:59.688 --> 00:02:08.219
Javob: y kvadrat teng x kvadrat ko‘paytirilgan qavs ichida ikki natural logarifm modul x plyus C.

22
00:02:08.219 --> 00:02:10.682
Qavs va modul belgisi muhim.

23
00:02:10.682 --> 00:02:16.574
Oxirgi qadamni unutmang: javobni doim eski o‘zgaruvchilarda yozing.

24
00:02:16.824 --> 00:02:25.938
Yo‘nalish maydoniga qarang: koordinata boshidan chiqadigan har bir nur bo‘ylab kesmalar bir xil qiyalikka ega.

25
00:02:25.938 --> 00:02:29.170
Bu bir jinslilikning geometrik ma’nosi.

26
00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:36.378
Shuning uchun bitta integral chiziqni koordinata boshiga nisbatan cho‘zsak yoki siqsak,

27
00:02:36.378 --> 00:02:39.278
yana integral chiziq hosil bo‘ladi.

28
00:02:39.528 --> 00:02:46.353
Tekshiruv savoli: y teng u karra x bo‘lsa, y shtrix nimaga teng?

29
00:02:46.353 --> 00:02:49.766
Ko‘paytmaning hosilasini eslang.
